    "GPIO34 / 35 / VP / VN: input only",
    "VP = GPIO36 · VN = GPIO39",
    "3V3: regulated 3.3 V output",
    "VIN: leave open with USB power"
  ],
  "notes": [
    "This profile describes the photographed WROOM board. Use its printed GPIO labels. Never apply negative voltage or 5 V directly to a GPIO. The configured 3.3 V ceiling is a wiring limit, not a silicon absolute-maximum rating. ADC measurement ranges are narrower.",
    "Signals can back-power an unpowered board. Disconnect signals before removing board power. Documentation settings do not change physical components or firmware capabilities."
  ],
